\begin{equation} \sup_{x \in \mathbb{R}^n}  \sup_{0 \leq \rho \le \rho^*} ~ Q_n(x, \rho) \left( \bigg | \frac{\hat{\sigma}^2_n}{1 + \rho} - 1 \bigg | > \varepsilon \right) \to 0.
